[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is a Path Traversal issue. This occurs because the code constructs file paths by directly combining user-supplied destination and archive entry paths without proper validation or sanitization. If the tar file contains entries with relative paths (e.g., "../../evil_file"), they could be extracted outside the intended destination directory, potentially overwriting critical system files or executing malicious payloads.

